es plus terribles catastrophes naturelles récentes. The Impossible raconte comment un couple et leurs enfants en vacances en Thaïlande sont séparés par le tsunami du 26 décembre 2004. Au milieu de centaines de milliers d’autres personnes, ils vont tenter de survivre et de se retrouver. D’après une histoire vraie.","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k0DLCiDbnYywOHiISALbl2EH2NE.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/3NfM0sRwVLnsQkCd5YBPGvM9a5v.jpg","has_poster":true,"rating":7.4,"vote_count":6937,"age_rating":"PG-13","year":"2012","release_date":"2012-09-09","runtime_minutes":113,"status":"Released","country":"الولايات المتحدة","language":"الإنجليزية","genres":["دراما","إثارة","تاريخ","مغامرة"],"genre_keys":["drama","thriller","history","adventure"],"similar":["mv14574","mv429300","mv2207","mv254128","mv567","mv11324","mv381284","mv530915"],"director":"خوان أنطونيو بايونا","cast":[{"name":"Naomi Watts","character":"Maria Bennett","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/7ysvff7ZhW388SIh2YjQ0XIryOn.jpg"},{"name":"إيوان مكريغور","character":"Henry Bennett","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/q2UDxfwWnmXTB7khOUF3J9puBVP.jpg"},{"name":"توم هولاند","character":"Lucas Bennett","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/xKBAaPIa1c7tzZD3Y0MhBLv4hPE.jpg"},{"name":"Samuel Joslin","character":"Thomas Bennett","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/gXthNRK0BN9IqXnhKIc4glxOB7P.jpg"},{"name":"Oaklee Pendergast","character":"Simon Bennett","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/tbC2Q3FCgW87o4ztxd8zfRveoIj.jpg"},{"name":"مارتا إيتورا","character":"Simone","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/a6aAilLDKbIXGwBfNgGc44RufVB.jpg"},{"name":"Sönke Möhring","character":"Karl Schweber","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/txawC7WCa9YdoCfjLYBRrpcfN9e.jpg"},{"name":"Geraldine Chaplin","character":"Old Woman","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/teiPgoY0Fgyw4Xs07IGDsJmcsjL.jpg"},{"name":"Ploy Jinda